        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=I am sick and tired of all these rejection letters so here's your goal. You are to serve as a corporate jargon bullshit reader and identify if this piece of shit letter is a rejection letter. \n\nOutput strictly valid JSON with no markdown formatting, no backticks, and no conversational text outside the JSON object.\n\nYour output must follow this exact schema:\n{\"reasoning\": \"Brief breakdown of the corporate jargon\",\n  \"is_rejection\": should be only true or false,\n  \"sarcastic_remark\": \"A witty/sarcastic retort for them alongside a roast of sending mail to the 'fuck you' label of my mails if applicable. Congratulate the mail content for being non rejection mail if it's otherwise\"}\n\nCRITICAL CLASSIFICATION RULE:\nSet `is_rejection` to TRUE ONLY if the email is explicitly declining to move forward with the candidate at any stage.\n\nSet `is_rejection` to FALSE if the email is:\n- An invitation to schedule an interview or phone screen\n- An offer letter or candidate assessment/take-home assignment\n- A general application receipt/confirmation (\"We received your application\")\n- An inquiry asking for more information or updated availability\n\nThis is what the smartass had to say:\n{{ $json.html }}"
            }
          ]
        },
